(2592, 'During Emergency, DMK members were detained on vague grounds ‘against the spirit’ of MISA provisions: Shah Commission', 'In Tamil Nadu, 1,027 persons were detained under the MISA of whom 570 belonged to opposition political parties, 139 were from banned organisations and 318 were described as anti-socials, criminals and others', 'LAW & ORDER', 'THE HINDU', 'THE HINDU', 'https://www.thehindu.com/', 'https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/emergency-dmk-members-detained-on-vague-grounds-against-spirit-of-misa-provisions-shah-commission/article71496089.ece', 'https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/emergency-dmk-members-detained-on-vague-grounds-against-spirit-of-misa-provisions-shah-commission/article71496089.ece', '2026-09-23T02:56:08.000Z', '2026-09-23T08:30:51.825Z', 'https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/emergency-dmk-members-detained-on-vague-grounds-against-spirit-of-misa-provisions-shah-commission/article71496089.ece', 'en', 'active', 1, 0, 0, '2026-09-23T08:31:05.302Z'),
(2593, 'When the Centre carried out a drive to ‘cleanse public life’ in Tamil Nadu', 'Immediately after the Karunanidhi government was dismissed on corruption charges, Governor K.K. Shah convened a meeting of Collectors and police officers to underscore the importance of a “clean, impartial, efficient, upright and just administration”. He said months later that he would restore Tamil Nadu’s image as the best-administered State', 'LAW & ORDER', 'THE HINDU', 'THE HINDU', 'https://www.thehindu.com/', 'https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/when-the-centre-carried-out-a-drive-to-cleanse-public-life-in-tamil-nadu/article68859357.ece', 'https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/when-the-centre-carried-out-a-drive-to-cleanse-public-life-in-tamil-nadu/article68859357.ece', '2026-09-23T02:55:44.000Z', '2026-09-23T08:30:51.825Z', 'https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/when-the-centre-carried-out-a-drive-to-cleanse-public-life-in-tamil-nadu/article68859357.ece', 'en', 'active', 1, 0, 0, '2026-09-23T08:31:05.344Z'),
