(1099, '‘My gesture during Assembly speech inadvertent’: Tamil Nadu CM Vijay', 'The Chief Minister’s clarification came after CPI(M) State secretary P. Shanmugam took strong objection to Mr. Vijay “body-shaming” former Chief Minister and DMK president M.K. Stalin over the broken jaw Mr. Stalin suffered during his detention under MISA when the Emergency was imposed in India.', 'LAW & ORDER', 'THE HINDU', 'THE HINDU', 'https://www.thehindu.com/', 'https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/my-gesture-during-assembly-speech-is-inadvertent-has-no-ulterior-motive-tamil-nadu-cm-vijay/article71442647.ece', 'https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/my-gesture-during-assembly-speech-is-inadvertent-has-no-ulterior-motive-tamil-nadu-cm-vijay/article71442647.ece', '2026-09-08T13:53:33.000Z', '2026-09-09T09:57:27.479Z', 'https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/my-gesture-during-assembly-speech-is-inadvertent-has-no-ulterior-motive-tamil-nadu-cm-vijay/article71442647.ece', 'en', 'active', 1, 0, 0, '2026-09-09T09:57:40.668Z'),
